1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,720
(This story is entirely fictional)
It's all for yourself!

2
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,039
Can't you listen to me just once?

3
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:16,280
Can't you try to understand me?

4
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,960
(Based on the novel
Doctor Qin: Executer)

5
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:32,000
Xiaoya...

6
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:36,200
Xiaoya?

7
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,520
(Mr. Zhang, you asked for me?)

8
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:01,840
Mr. Zhang.

9
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,439
Mr. Zhang.

10
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,560
Xiaoya...

11
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,519
She was drunk.

12
00:01:27,359 --> 00:01:28,159
Got worked up.

13
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:30,719
And fell.

14
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:33,879
Quick, clean it up.

15
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,680
Got it.

16
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:07,240
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 21=

17
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,319
Who are you?

18
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,639
Come over.

19
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,439
Do it!

20
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:17,319
Play it.

21
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,520
This is only a small part of the copies.

22
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,520
I was planning

23
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,759
to have you cancel

24
00:03:35,759 --> 00:03:36,960
Xiaoxue's debt.

25
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:39,120
But now,

26
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:42,159
for your innocent daughter's sake too,

27
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,159
I want 500k yuan.

28
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:45,960
500k for Xiaoxue.

29
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,439
In cash.

30
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:52,479
And stay away from her.

31
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,520
No negotiating.

32
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,960
Hurry up.

33
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:00,120
Do it!

34
00:04:06,599 --> 00:04:07,400
Sir,

35
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,319
stop the car.

36
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:13,920
(FAN A 71954)

37
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,839
Drop it there.

38
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,480
One, two, three, lift!

39
00:06:01,879 --> 00:06:02,600
Mr. Zhang.

40
00:06:02,639 --> 00:06:03,519
Come back here.

41
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:06,400
(Parking Full)

42
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,960
(Parking Full)

43
00:07:36,959 --> 00:07:37,759
Keep running.

44
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,120
Keep running!

45
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,279
Why'd you stop?

46
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:01,639
Wen.

47
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,600
Wen.

48
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:07,120
Wen...

49
00:08:12,079 --> 00:08:12,639
Wen!

50
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,279
Run...

51
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,720
Run...

52
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,879
Watch out for Zhang Xiaodong...

53
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,279
Run...

54
00:08:30,639 --> 00:08:31,720
Run...

55
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,279
Run...

56
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:45,320
Boss, what about her?

57
00:08:45,399 --> 00:08:46,720
It's fine. Let her watch.

58
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,240
Xia Wen...

59
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,360
Wen...

60
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,480
Come on. Look at me.

61
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,240
Look at me!

62
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,039
Listen.

63
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:02,080
She's at the end.

64
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,720
I'll give you a chance to live.

65
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,720
Choke her to death. Right now.

66
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,000
Then we'll be in this together.

67
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:07,840
You hear me?

68
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:10,320
I can't let you call the cops on me.

69
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:13,080
So you have to choke her now!

70
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:16,279
I can't! I can't...

71
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,159
Hand me that.

72
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,120
Look closely.

73
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,519
No!

74
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,799
Choke her!

75
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:33,919
Right now!

76
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,639
Choke her! Hurry!

77
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,320
Do it!

78
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,960
I can't...

79
00:09:45,879 --> 00:09:47,039
I don't want to...

80
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,120
I don't want to!

81
00:09:52,159 --> 00:09:53,080
I don't want to...

82
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,799
Let's end this pain...

83
00:10:05,159 --> 00:10:07,399
Let's end it...

84
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,159
Give her a big hand!

85
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,519
Miss Jin!

86
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:32,759
Welcome to the team.

87
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,000
Let's go.

88
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,159
How did you find the body?

89
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,960
I was out for a walk

90
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,639
(Police)
when I saw someone lying there.

91
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,320
Do you come here for walks often?

92
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:16,440
Yeah. I live nearby.

93
00:11:21,799 --> 00:11:22,600
Qin Ming.

94
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,639
The first shot you fired

95
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,000
made me feel truly relieved.

96
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,600
All these years of guilt

97
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:35,000
have finally eased a little.

98
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,279
The second shot

99
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,639
was my selfish way to confirm

100
00:11:44,559 --> 00:11:46,720
your feelings for me
over the past decade.

101
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:52,360
Qin Ming.

102
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:56,440
Thanks for all of it.

103
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,639
Keke!

104
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:20,840
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

105
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:25,440
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

106
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:29,680
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

107
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:34,240
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

108
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:44,040
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

109
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:47,480
This is the second time
we've held hands.

110
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,620
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

111
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,639
And it might be the last.

112
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:54,360
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

113
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:57,720
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

114
00:12:58,160 --> 00:13:02,520
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

115
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:07,280
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

116
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:11,600
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

117
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:16,000
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

118
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:23,840
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

119
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:28,879
Qin Ming.

120
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,799
If we could go back to that rooftop,

121
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:37,240
you'd pull me out of the darkness,

122
00:13:37,879 --> 00:13:38,679
wouldn't you?

123
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:41,879
Yes.

124
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:50,760
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

125
00:13:57,399 --> 00:13:59,080
Mr. Dong, you wanted to see me?

126
00:14:02,759 --> 00:14:05,159
Jin Keke will only talk to you.

127
00:14:05,279 --> 00:14:06,639
I'll make an exception

128
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:08,440
and let you question her.

129
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,840
(Police)

130
00:14:46,279 --> 00:14:47,120
Did you sleep well?

131
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:58,120
I finally stopped having nightmares.

132
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,320
Officer Qin,

133
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,679
why don't you get some rest?

134
00:15:03,559 --> 00:15:04,639
After all,

135
00:15:06,399 --> 00:15:08,080
you were my hostage all night.

136
00:15:08,399 --> 00:15:09,200
Hostage?

137
00:15:11,679 --> 00:15:13,320
But you never hurt me.

138
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,279
Officer Qin,
where would you like to start?

139
00:15:22,279 --> 00:15:23,639
Was He Guifen's death

140
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:25,519
planned or an accident?

141
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,600
She wasn't on my revenge list.

142
00:15:29,759 --> 00:15:31,240
I felt sorry for Xu Meng.

143
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,399
So I wanted her to pay up for Xu Meng.

144
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,960
However, He Guifen was so hot-tempered

145
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:40,039
that she angered herself to death.

146
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,200
I'm your daughter, Xu Meng.

147
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,440
You're Xu Meng?

148
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,279
You're not Xu Meng.

149
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,240
Who are you?

150
00:15:51,879 --> 00:15:52,879
What do you want?

151
00:15:52,919 --> 00:15:54,039
What do I want?

152
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:56,799
I'm collecting Xu Meng's debt.

153
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:58,200
All these years,

154
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,559
you've been living off

155
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:02,000
Xu Meng's blood money, right?

156
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,600
When her father died,

157
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,600
as her stepmother,

158
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,879
you took the compensation

159
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,200
and sold her to Zhang Xiaodong.

160
00:16:09,679 --> 00:16:11,159
You've been bleeding her dry.

161
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:13,399
Don't you feel any guilt?

162
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,399
Nonsense!

163
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:16,440
What on earth do you want?

164
00:16:16,759 --> 00:16:18,480
Should I spell out

165
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,679
every cut you got

166
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:22,360
from Zhang Xiaodong?

167
00:16:23,399 --> 00:16:25,279
I've traced every kickback you took

168
00:16:25,879 --> 00:16:27,399
for pimping Xu Meng out

169
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,200
to those bosses.

170
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,440
You... you jerk!

171
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:34,279
Oh, Ms. He,

172
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,600
I should warn you.

173
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,039
You need to pack up and move.

174
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,200
The bank will be taking your house soon.

175
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:44,840
You... you liar!

176
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,240
Pay me back!

177
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,600
I'm calling the police.

178
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:50,480
I'll have you all arrested!

179
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:51,759
Oh, right.

180
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:54,000
I've transferred the money.

181
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:56,039
And that contract was fake too.

182
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,480
You'll lose everything.

183
00:16:58,919 --> 00:17:00,559
Enjoy your later years,

184
00:17:02,519 --> 00:17:04,079
if you have any left.

185
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,039
Xu Meng said

186
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,079
she had nightmares too.

187
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:17,519
Because

188
00:17:18,039 --> 00:17:20,440
she'd also witnessed
Zhang Xiaoya's death.

189
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,279
We are sparrows trapped in a cage.

190
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,039
Xia Wen...

191
00:17:36,599 --> 00:17:39,160
She's the hunter
who saved us with her life.

192
00:17:39,839 --> 00:17:42,039
So for ten years,

193
00:17:47,279 --> 00:17:50,599
I turned myself into a crow.

194
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:53,680
I'll peck out the eyes of those bad guys

195
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:56,480
and leave them to rot in the dark.

196
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:03,839
My weapon is...

197
00:18:07,319 --> 00:18:08,759
their own evil.

198
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:20,790
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

199
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:25,660
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

200
