♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

203
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:49,880
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

204
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:54,020
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

205
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:58,250
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

206
00:18:58,250 --> 00:19:02,970
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

207
00:19:02,970 --> 00:19:07,120
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

208
00:19:07,990 --> 00:19:11,770
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

209
00:19:11,770 --> 00:19:15,860
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

210
00:19:24,820 --> 00:19:29,030
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

211
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:33,370
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

212
00:19:33,370 --> 00:19:37,140
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

213
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:40,040
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

214
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:44,830
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

215
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:49,480
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

216
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:51,740
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

217
00:19:51,740 --> 00:19:53,880
♪We stop here in this night♪

218
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:58,300
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

219
00:19:58,300 --> 00:20:04,280
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

